{"h":11508,"lines":[{"h":0.024050430646018306,"text":"until, in the vision of God, we have become quite quiescent","conf":1,"x":0.12100866274859265,"y":0.92709106888691228,"w":0.81976234138786019},{"y":0.9069767445168978,"text":"(passivi) both as regards our inner and outer life.\"1 \"This is","x":0.12114016082534264,"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1,"h":0.02184270014838563},{"w":0.81710211023107759,"text":"certainly harsh and painful. For that the soul should be","y":0.883680555338754,"x":0.12114014947670199,"h":0.021842700148385741,"conf":1},{"x":0.12114015015953115,"text":"denuded of all its motions of understanding and willing,","conf":1,"y":0.86185515896671938,"w":0.81947742808948854,"h":0.020412282338218124},{"x":0.12114017002721526,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.83854166700520305,"h":0.021923449304368736,"text":"signifies its entrance into darkness, as it were, the darkness of","conf":1},{"w":0.81710211023107759,"text":"destruction and death; and from this extremity it shrinks","y":0.81686046541986868,"h":0.020441121525234696,"x":0.12114014947670199,"conf":1},{"text":"violently.\"2 \"This happens however through the faith in","y":0.79360465158550308,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.12114016578707382,"h":0.023359634573497434},{"h":0.020360372369251589,"text":"which man surrenders his understanding to the word of the","y":0.77180232572994623,"x":0.12114015918374862,"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"cross, in the power of which he renounces himself and his all,","x":0.12114014963505511,"h":0.020383443151201552,"y":0.74851190513048016,"conf":1},{"text":"becoming dead to himself and to all things. And thus he lives","x":0.12351544399243024,"y":0.72668650809719215,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.020406514879257043,"conf":1},{"x":0.12114015205785801,"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1,"y":0.70337301631506621,"h":0.021917680899302239,"text":"for God alone, for whom all live, even the dead.\" 3 \"For God"},{"y":0.68023255819987583,"conf":1,"x":0.12114015545453254,"h":0.021900378522418773,"text":"saves none but the sinner, He instructs none but the foolish","w":0.81710211023107748},{"conf":1,"y":0.6584302330181897,"x":0.12114014602651454,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021877306794363394,"text":"and unwise, He makes none rich but the poor, He makes"},{"h":0.021854236012413319,"conf":1,"text":"none living but the dead.\"4 \"For him who refuses to take","x":0.12351544678469903,"y":0.63662790694624216,"w":0.81710211023107759},{"text":"upon himself the suffering of the cross, God, the Creator,","conf":1,"y":0.61145104105060055,"h":0.023982435937911828,"w":0.81733138839919839,"x":0.12341392408896218},{"h":0.018912652182200618,"y":0.59300595206747275,"x":0.12351546000718483,"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"does not exist at all; for such a one refuses to become as","conf":1},{"text":"nothing that the Creator might be manifested to him.\"5","conf":1,"x":0.12351544638881598,"w":0.81710211023107759,"y":0.56969246044280797,"h":0.020423818202245814},{"h":0.026473444605630614,"conf":1,"y":0.54499708582924078,"text":"Then only do we love God \"when there is nothing visible,","x":0.12332102321286255,"w":0.81990175123338571},{"y":0.52325581426818979,"w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.021883074253324475,"x":0.12351546136902164,"conf":1,"text":"tangible for us any more, neither within nor without, to"},{"text":"which confidence, love or fear could turn, but solely He who","conf":1,"x":0.12333441542178147,"y":0.49891265743019886,"w":0.81742442737926135,"h":0.02466060055626762},{"text":"is above all things, the invisible, the unapproachable, the","w":0.8198068296754516,"y":0.47537029857127799,"conf":1,"x":0.12095448896689956,"h":0.02613588174184156},{"y":0.45458072072631006,"h":0.025092188328031506,"w":0.81729621391791807,"x":0.12340691968299802,"text":"incomprehensible, God. This means, however, when man is","conf":1},{"y":0.4330357143022715,"x":0.12589074260189176,"w":0.81472684191418954,"h":0.021906145981379965,"conf":1,"text":"torn away into the heart of darkness, and does not know"},{"w":0.81273606535676235,"x":0.12569470022246582,"y":0.40972897816712861,"text":"what he should love, when he only knows what he should","conf":1,"h":0.024432833232576834},{"w":0.81235152405577815,"h":0.01909722222222221,"conf":1,"text":"not love; when he repudiates all that he can know and","y":0.39087301573433419,"x":0.12589074048313906},{"h":0.02564268642001688,"text":"experience, and longs only for the One whom he does not","conf":1,"y":0.36372303893058788,"x":0.12566325369949485,"w":0.81753857104809269},{"conf":1,"text":"yet know.\"6 \"Thus hope bears us away into the unknown,","y":0.34040360332379738,"w":0.817785188749239,"x":0.12563084877341021,"h":0.028818926167866521},{"conf":1,"y":0.32266865039619008,"h":0.021825396825396859,"text":"the hidden, the innermost darkness. It knows not for what","x":0.12589074500322622,"w":0.81710211023107759},{"conf":1,"x":0.12324235547911445,"y":0.29568292760465342,"w":0.78667137839577417,"h":0.027057491597675121,"text":"it should hope; it knows only for what it must not hope.\""},{"conf":1,"w":0.78384795746245939,"h":0.023376937896486316,"y":0.2760416664288633,"x":0.15914490772957793,"text":"Should anyone reply: \"When Luther speaks thus about"},{"conf":1,"y":0.25046196815462141,"w":0.81284173742517252,"h":0.02755903630029588,"x":0.12800486793363808,"text":"man's being led into the realms of darkness, he has in mind"},{"y":0.22858303123154311,"x":0.1256229712813727,"conf":1,"text":"only very special life experiences; it does not happen to all","h":0.027163144141908679,"w":0.81999161955598121},{"text":"men that their way leads through suffering!\" I do not","h":0.024507787492540123,"y":0.20723030383927432,"x":0.1281235083622328,"w":0.81738732077858667,"conf":1},{"y":0.18304693521013116,"conf":1,"w":0.81778137405197338,"text":"know whether any one to-day is thinking on these lines,","h":0.026347991019960437,"x":0.12792640573874395},{"x":0.12797298507278365,"text":"to-day when all of us are involved in suffering and depriva-","y":0.160894207645353,"conf":1,"h":0.026008679753258046,"w":0.81764533303000708},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"conf":1,"y":0.14236111072760049,"h":0.023336563791547582,"text":"tion, and when even those who are better off than most have","x":0.12826603904123102},{"x":0.16389548709141719,"conf":1,"text":"1 Rom. II, 203, 4M.","w":0.18764845117346032,"h":0.01895879469220596,"y":0.11185515857030648},{"h":0.018964562151167152,"conf":1,"y":0.10901162835085954,"text":"2 11, 206, 14f.","w":0.15676959149249192,"x":0.42042755775731699},{"h":0.019068511705549906,"x":0.64130269516061256,"text":"3 II, 245, 12ff.","conf":1,"y":0.10747155817511977,"w":0.15919983851445185},{"w":0.15682095366638976,"conf":1,"text":"4 II, 252, 18ff.","h":0.017614650347876126,"x":0.16386981016205132,"y":0.097297325986692385},{"text":"5 II, 135, 24ff.","conf":1,"x":0.36104513103522679,"y":0.09447674470260381,"h":0.01889534791310632,"w":0.15676959149249187},{"x":0.56508452099999751,"w":0.15724188321596611,"h":0.01909894413418245,"conf":1,"text":"6 II, 138, 28ff.","y":0.092194713811063256},{"x":0.76471509494331003,"conf":1,"y":0.092610050528597943,"text":"7 II, 202, 5ff.","w":0.14515413556780132,"h":0.018268271098061173},{"text":"234","w":0.049881235345617503,"h":0.015988372621082214,"conf":1,"y":0.069767441669109975,"x":0.51068883636519602}],"page":230,"w":7029}